// The mesh module's public surface: build both flattened lists once at
// startup (meshbuild/) -- same shape as demos/gl3d/scene/mesh/api.id. The
// terrain never changes after this, so the per-frame cost is just rebuilding
// the camera matrices (flight/), not rebuilding geometry.

mesh_initialize() {
  build_vertices();
  build_colors();
} return void;
